{"id": "Den-laxymDN", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "The Devi cast off her outer sheath, and her colour became white. From that sheath rose Devi Kaushiki 🤍\n\nFrom the Shiva Purana (Vayaviya Samhita, chapters 25 to 27): Brahma told her that the Shakti she released would end Shumbh and Nishumbh. She cast off her outer sheath and became white. The sheath became Devi Kaushiki, dark as a rain cloud, with eight arms, and Brahma gave her a lion. Gauri returned to Mandara with the tiger walking ahead, and Mahadev embraced her: whatever your colour, my heart is drawn to your feeling.\n\nHer dhyana mantra: Shvete vrishe samarudha, shvetambaradhara shuchih. Mahagauri shubham dadyan, Mahadeva pramodada.\n\nNavdurga, Day 8, Part 2 of 2. Told as Tholu Bommalata, Andhra's leather shadow puppets 🪔\n\nSource: Shiva Purana, Vayaviya Samhita, chapters 25 to 27\n\nSend this to the one who loves you exactly as you are 🤍\n\nHappy Ashtami 🙏\n\n#maamahagauri #kaushiki #durgaashtami #shivapurana #mahadev", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792302970, "like_count": 7186, "comment_count": 18, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-28742512388733267a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 53.98, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOO2GC6hZvVPyC7wUVArCuk_zO8ir4jS8vGIoOz9bmXn67BTwmuxh2NQcETmDWXPfYrTDAjSwo0Gq08bjYO8UpVx8qYNoOe3PrSa48.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdprAKM5XqEPYvPK_0i00MqBNd7-FxcTYl9i_VvW0S15xyf1xJDqf4aVukyJYRmuPlvj5PgoNCtBOvrLHrfREN0Y&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Y5uiCxbHxs4Q7kNvwFt2DLk&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=l8cz8rVi1KdlhdJY7xR_HQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSiSq6tVovUSH3XHgCf9MEkzLHKmwGfcxSuLYBQF7AoRQ&oe=6AF41AB1", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods"